    "text": "<math><mn>12</mn></math>&nbsp;people are asked questions in succession in a random order and exactly <math><mn>3</mn></math>&nbsp;out of <math><mn>12</mn></math> people know the answer. The probability that the&nbsp;<math><msup><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow></msup></math> person asked is the <math><msup><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></msup></math> person to know the answer, is"
